    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 171, Number 146 (Monday, September 8, 2025)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. CRAWFORD:\nH.R. 5167.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nCongress has the authority to enact this legislation\npursuant to Article I, Section 8 of the U.S. Constitution,\nwhich states, in part that Congress shall have the power to\n``provide for the common defense and general welfare of the\nUnited States. . .'' and ``to make all laws which shall be\nnecessary and proper for carying into execution the foregoing\npowers.''\n[Page H3892]\n</pre>",
